  <div class=\"ca-hero-content\">\n      <img\n        class=\"ca-hero-shield\"\n        src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0690\/4522\/3590\/files\/Gemini_Generated_Image_qcg239qcg239qcg2.png?v=1779930032\"\n        alt=\"Protocol Apothecary\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        height=\"160\"\n      >\n      <div class=\"ca-hero-text\">\n        <div class=\"ca-badge\">✦ Healthy Kindness · Curated Wellness<\/div>\n        <h1>Protocol <span>Apothecary<\/span><\/h1>\n        <p class=\"ca-hero-sub\">Botanicals · Natural Extracts · Wellness Tools<\/p>\n        <p>The Protocol Apothecary is where the Five Protocols meet physical practice. Every product in this collection is selected for alignment with one or more of the Fifth Protocol curricula — sourced with intention, formulated cleanly, and introduced alongside education so you understand what each tool supports and why it belongs in your daily life.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- FIVE PROTOCOL CONNECTIONS -->\n  <div class=\"ca-label\" style=\"font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;color:#C9A84C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n    <span style=\"width:24px;height:1px;background:#C9A84C;display:inline-block;\"><\/span>\n    Rooted in the Five Protocols\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"ca-protocol-strip\">\n    <a class=\"ca-proto-card body\" href=\"\/pages\/body\">\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-icon\">🌿<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-num\">Protocol 01<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-name\">Body<\/span>\n    <\/a>\n    <a class=\"ca-proto-card mind\" href=\"\/pages\/mind\">\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-icon\">🌀<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-num\">Protocol 02<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-name\">Mind<\/span>\n    <\/a>\n    <a class=\"ca-proto-card soul\" href=\"\/pages\/soul\">\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-icon\">✨<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-num\">Protocol 03<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-name\">Soul<\/span>\n    <\/a>\n    <a class=\"ca-proto-card earth\" href=\"\/pages\/earth\">\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-icon\">🌍<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-num\">Protocol 04<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-name\">Earth<\/span>\n    <\/a>\n    <a class=\"ca-proto-card universe\" href=\"\/pages\/universe\">\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-icon\">🌌<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-num\">Protocol 05<\/span>\n      <span class=\"ca-proto-name\">Universe<\/span>\n    <\/a>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- WHAT IT IS -->\n  <div class=\"ca-source\">\n    <div class=\"ca-source-text\">\n      <div class=\"ca-label\">The Purpose<\/div>\n      <h2>Where Education Meets <span>Daily Practice<\/span><\/h2>\n      <p>The Protocol Apothecary is the product home of the Fifth Protocol learning system. Every item here is a practical tool — something that supports the physical, mental, spiritual, environmental, or cosmological work the protocols teach.<\/p>\n      <p>These are not wellness products chosen for trend or margin. They are <strong>chosen for alignment<\/strong> — selected because they connect meaningfully to the science, the philosophy, and the daily habits the protocols are built to develop.<\/p>\n      <p>Use this collection as your protocol toolkit. Start with the protocol you are studying. Let the education tell you what each tool is for, and why it belongs in your practice.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-source-stats\">\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">📖<\/span>\n        <h4>Education-Led<\/h4>\n        <p>Every product is introduced inside a protocol lesson — never before it<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">🌿<\/span>\n        <h4>Clean Sourcing<\/h4>\n        <p>Botanical, natural, and consciously sourced across every category<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">🔬<\/span>\n        <h4>Purposeful<\/h4>\n        <p>Every product has a specific alignment to the protocol curriculum it supports<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">🤝<\/span>\n        <h4>Mission-Funded<\/h4>\n        <p>Every purchase directly supports the Fifth Protocol education mission<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- PHILOSOPHY -->\n  <div class=\"ca-philosophy\">\n    <blockquote>\n      \"Knowledge without tools is theory.<br>\n      Tools without knowledge are just <span>products.<\/span>\"\n    <\/blockquote>\n    <cite>Protocol Apothecary · Healthy Kindness · Fifth Protocol<\/cite>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- CATEGORIES -->\n  <div class=\"ca-categories\">\n    <div class=\"ca-label\">What's Inside<\/div>\n    <h2>Three Areas of <span>Protocol Support<\/span><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"ca-cat-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-cat-card body\">\n        <span class=\"ca-cat-icon\">💪<\/span>\n        <h3>Body &amp; Physical Foundation<\/h3>\n        <p>Tools that support the physical systems the Body Protocol teaches — hydration, mineral balance, nourishment, recovery, and daily physical care. The body is the vessel through which all growth occurs.<\/p>\n        <ul class=\"ca-cat-items\">\n          <li>Hydration &amp; mineral support<\/li>\n          <li>Recovery &amp; repair tools<\/li>\n          <li>Nourishment &amp; performance<\/li>\n          <li>Natural body care<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"ca-cat-card mind\">\n        <span class=\"ca-cat-icon\">🧠<\/span>\n        <h3>Mind &amp; Cognitive Support<\/h3>\n        <p>Tools that support the cognitive and emotional work the Mind Protocol teaches — focus, mental clarity, stress regulation, and the neurological foundations of learning and decision-making.<\/p>\n        <ul class=\"ca-cat-items\">\n          <li>Cognitive nutrition &amp; brain support<\/li>\n          <li>Adaptogen &amp; stress-regulation blends<\/li>\n          <li>Focus &amp; mental clarity tools<\/li>\n          <li>Sleep support for cognitive recovery<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"ca-cat-card earth\">\n        <span class=\"ca-cat-icon\">🌍<\/span>\n        <h3>Earth &amp; Botanical Wisdom<\/h3>\n        <p>Tools drawn from the natural world — plant medicines, wildcrafted botanicals, natural extracts, and conscious personal care products aligned with the Earth Protocol's teachings on natural systems and stewardship.<\/p>\n        <ul class=\"ca-cat-items\">\n          <li>Wildcrafted &amp; plant-based botanicals<\/li>\n          <li>Natural extracts &amp; functional fungi<\/li>\n          <li>Food-source &amp; whole-plant nutrition<\/li>\n          <li>Conscious &amp; clean personal care<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- STANDARDS -->\n  <div class=\"ca-standards-header\">\n    <div class=\"ca-label\">Our Standards<\/div>\n    <h2>What We Will <span>Never Compromise<\/span><\/h2>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-standards\">\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">📖<\/span>\n      <h4>Education First<\/h4>\n      <p>No product in this collection exists without a curriculum connection. Tools follow understanding — always.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🚫<\/span>\n      <h4>No Unnecessary Fillers<\/h4>\n      <p>Every formulation contains only what needs to be there. No artificial bulking agents, synthetic dyes, or label dressing.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🌍<\/span>\n      <h4>Responsible Sourcing<\/h4>\n      <p>We work only with suppliers who meet our standards for ingredient quality, purity, and ethical sourcing practices.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🔬<\/span>\n      <h4>Purposeful Formulation<\/h4>\n      <p>Every ingredient earns its place. Nothing is added for trend, cost savings, or marketing — only for function.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">📅<\/span>\n      <h4>Consistency Over Hype<\/h4>\n      <p>These tools are built for daily use and long-term habit. We do not sell quick fixes or miracle claims.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- MISSION -->\n  <div class=\"ca-mission\">\n    <div class=\"ca-mission-icon\">🤝<\/div>\n    <div>\n      <h3>Every Purchase <span>Funds the Mission<\/span><\/h3>\n      <p>The Protocol Apothecary is powered by <strong>Healthy Kindness<\/strong> — and every product you buy supports the <strong>Fifth Protocol mission<\/strong> of educating communities with truth, empowering individuals with real tools for their health, and giving nonprofits a better way to fundraise than selling junk food.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- TAGLINE -->\n  <div class=\"ca-tagline\">\n    <span>Be True.<\/span> Live Well.\n  <\/div>\n\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"banner":{"type":"main-collection-banner","settings":{"show_collection_description":true,"show_collection_image":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1"}},"product-grid":{"type":"main-collection-product-grid","settings":{"products_per_page":24,"columns_desktop":4,"columns_mobile":"2","color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_ratio":"portrait","image_shape":"default","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"quick_add":"standard","enable_filtering":true,"filter_type":"horizontal","enable_sorting":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":60}}},"order":["custom_liquid_zk9WrF","banner","product-grid"]}